<p>Hello Labdoo missioner:</p>

<p>You are receiving this email because you or someone within the Labdoo social project has registered a dootrip that you may be part of.</p>

<p>Just a quick explanation in case you are not familiar with this. A dootrip is a trip that you or someone is doing and that can be repurposed to bring a laptop or an education device (tablets, netbooks, etc.) to a school in a way that no additional CO2 emissions are generated.</p>

<p>You can see this new dootrip from the following link: [DOOTRIP_URL]</p>

<p>If you see any error you have the right to edit and correct it, or feel free to let us know at [CONTACT_EMAIL]. This will help keep the inventory as up to date as possible.</p>

<p>You can now use the toolbelt you will find in your Labdoo dashboard to contribute further in bringing a device to a needy education project: [DASHBOARD_URL]</p>

<p>Thanks for taking good care of your mini-mission to help bring a device loaded with education software to a needy edoovillage. Together we can bridge the digital divide!</p>

<p>The Labdoo Team | platform.labdoo.org</p>
